  <item>
    <title>010.我们的 阿勒泰 ②｜丝路 新疆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667f78475c33fe90f598cc75</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667f78475c33fe90f598cc75</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 29 Jun 2024 02:58:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我不是一个没有来历的人，我走到今天，似乎是我的祖先在使用我的身体——《我的阿勒泰》李娟</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part-1 &nbsp;阿勒泰还有什么？从高晓亮的遭遇谈起</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 宝藏山系阿尔泰山，可以找到金子、玛瑙、太空陨石......在额尔齐斯河，我国境内唯一一条注入北冰洋的河，可以捕到冷水鱼。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a> 春夏牧场的绿野、秋天的斑斓山林、去冬天的童话世界滑雪（是粉雪哦！）、在没有牧羊人的可可托海苏式小镇怀旧。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Part-2 &nbsp;深入阿尔泰山</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 阿尔泰山与欧洲的生物区系有着很高的相似度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 游牧，不仅仅是一种生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part-3 &nbsp;&nbsp;草原之路上的阿尔泰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 草原文明大通道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3870">64:30</a> 去博物馆感受草原之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4150">69:10</a> 李娟之外，那些新疆的作家们</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期时联TALK提到的</span><strong><span>阿勒泰地区文物保护单位</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>墩德布拉克洞穴彩绘岩画</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿勒泰市汗德尕特乡 &nbsp;旧石器时代 &nbsp;自治区文保单位 2013年 第七批</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>切木尔切可石人及石棺幕群、喀腊塔斯石人墓）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>阿勒泰市 阿勒泰地区 &nbsp;国5 古墓葬 &nbsp;魏</span><em><span>（特别提醒：现在立于公路旁的是复制品）</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>三海子墓葬及鹿石 &nbsp;阿勒泰地区 青河县</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>国5 古墓葬 &nbsp;青铜时代</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期联现人</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>麦克抽</span></strong><span>： &nbsp;西域探索者，丝路文化旅行顾问。目前定位河西走廊。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小红薯ID </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5672869ae00dd85e34503f47?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=561cf5b9a75c956930a1f215&amp;apptime=1717814738&amp;share_id=63e1ac8d377d42b1b5fd9855716f6ea9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5672869ae00dd85e34503f47?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=561cf5b9a75c956930a1f215&amp;apptime=1717814738&amp;share_id=63e1ac8d377d42b1b5fd9855716f6ea9"><span>麦克抽到处逛</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>璐子：粤地精疆人，野路子探保：国宝&amp;文保。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>小红薯ID &nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64853ebf0000000010036e89?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=561cf5b9a75c956930a1f215&amp;apptime=1717814656&amp;share_id=bbb5eb8d593e4e0ebf4691d08312249e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64853ebf0000000010036e89?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=561cf5b9a75c956930a1f215&amp;apptime=1717814656&amp;share_id=bbb5eb8d593e4e0ebf4691d08312249e"><span>野璐子breath new</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期音乐</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>哈萨克族音乐"黑走马"</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期相关阅读</span></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5HGnYqeYfxn6Zw3bC1tHAQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5HGnYqeYfxn6Zw3bC1tHAQ"><span>丝路｜喀什噶尔 古城风情之秋</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QhfHCwIATcxSyO4Iqam-VA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QhfHCwIATcxSyO4Iqam-VA"><span>丝路｜从喀什噶尔出发 阳光照在塔什库尔干</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Y_p94qiya9W9buyNjyXPsw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Y_p94qiya9W9buyNjyXPsw"><span>丝路｜从喀什噶尔出发 莎车的王妃和十二木卡姆</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><span>联系我们</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>公众号：时空联现</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：时空联现</span></p>]]></description>
