  <item>
    <title>008. 又见帕米尔：雪峰杏花人家｜丝路 从喀什噶尔出发</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644a2066306513184c89fe8a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644a2066306513184c89fe8a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Apr 2023 07:12:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>阳光总是照耀在塔什库尔干，这次，我们从最长的春天谈起</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 麦克从帕米尔高原下来了......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 从秋天到春天，帕米尔变了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 帕米尔最“长”的春天的关键词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 春天的杏花地图，追着杏花游新疆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 比起江南，杏花跟新疆更搭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">22:24</a>诺鲁兹节，是哪个民族的春节？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1435">23:55</a> 都是“春节”，这个节有什么不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a>跨越国境的塔吉克民族，是不是中国境内唯一的白种人民族?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 历史是想象的、地理是实践的：玄奘如何穿越帕米尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2278">37:58</a> "历史是想象的、地理是实践"：玄奘如何穿越帕米尔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 高原塔吉克的四季生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2660">44:20</a> 在帕米尔高原没有感受到高反？跳舞吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 一路向西，找寻塔吉克人喜欢围着火堆跳舞的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">51:50</a>婚礼、服饰、鹰舞......这些塔吉克民俗都是国家级非遗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3445">57:25</a>去帕米尔各种玩儿：拍星空、露营......没地儿住call乡长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 古道探险，在帕米尔玩户外</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期提到的文化遗产</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>遗址点</span></strong><span>:</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>吉尔赞喀勒墓地</span></strong><span>（曲什曼黑白石条古墓地） 东周 &nbsp;国8 ，塔什库尔干塔吉克自治县曲什曼村</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>非遗项目</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>塔吉克族民歌、塔吉克族服饰、鹰舞</span></p><span></span><p><span>塔吉克族婚俗、引水节和播种节</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期相关链接</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QhfHCwIATcxSyO4Iqam-VA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/QhfHCwIATcxSyO4Iqam-VA"><span>阳光照在塔什库尔干</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GI8TtSIpB7CcZrCKgPJOwg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GI8TtSIpB7CcZrCKgPJOwg"><span>塔什库尔干：花儿为什么这样红</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期音乐</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>古丽碧塔</span></strong><span> &nbsp;{ 沙热合曼·恰库尼&amp;万力·卡米力&amp;热合曼·买买提阿不扎力 }</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期联现人</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>麦克抽</span></strong><span>： 西域探索者&amp;旅居客，丝路文化旅行顾问。目前定居喀什</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>静静子</span></strong><span>：旅拍达人，资深色（摄）友</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>邓邓</span></strong><span>（联现主持）： 文化迷踪</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系我们 @</span></strong><span>公众号：时空联现</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6sTSzSew6cjGnKQN5kaq9rt7v9.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpIHv3ElighCUpVNSY9abiQDaCZR.m4a" length="65697986" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:42</itunes:duration>
