  <item>
    <title>007. 南海神庙的波罗诞为什么这么热闹? 灵啊！｜海丝 广州</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640d4a9a092eb63cb065790f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640d4a9a092eb63cb065790f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 Mar 2023 03:44:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsfLJdvVpP9_wM7MpS8usdKVJ1Sr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>一年前在深圳博物馆展出的番禺大神楼，引出了这场关于南海神庙千年庙会的TALK</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>PART 1 、一座大神楼、一场千年庙会波罗诞</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> &nbsp;一座大神楼引起的.....</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> &nbsp;上周六就在广州，南海神庙的波罗诞庙会热闹非凡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 南海神的行宫，就是去年在深博展出的番禺大神楼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 二月十三是南海神的正诞日</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>PART 、2 去南海神庙一定要祭拜的神仙</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 目前仅存的四海国家祭祀是由隋文帝开创的南海神祭祀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 明码头、清码头，历朝官员们如何祭拜南海神</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 南海神庙仍然有唐代码头的遗存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> 波罗王子是谁？如何在南海神庙找到波罗王子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 别忘了拜女神：洪圣王夫人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 普天同庆的庙会对于古代民众来讲，提供了难得的公共活动空间</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>PART 3 、名人胜迹：南方碑林</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 在南海神庙寻找名人胜迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 唐韩愈“南海神广利王庙碑” ：“海事”一词的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 宋开宝碑：“大宋新修南海广利王庙碑：记录了“市舶司”的建立</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> &nbsp;明：“洪武三年御碑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 如今，站在浴日亭上还能感受到东坡先生所题“南海浴日亭诗”的意境吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><em><strong><span>PART 4、 珠三角的游神活动</span></strong></em></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> 寻找南海神行宫-番禺大神楼的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3200">53:20</a> 珠三角地区的各路游神</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>PART 5、由南海神庙讲开去......</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 南海神庙跟海上丝路有关联吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">58:10</a> 古港海岸线变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">61:20</a> 海上丝路申遗在广州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">62:30</a> 安利：广州海事博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3850">64:10</a> 波罗鸡和庙头八乡</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期相关链接</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rFAD6cco7xJbPANambfyuA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/rFAD6cco7xJbPANambfyuA"><span>二月十三艳阳天 南海神庙波罗诞</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9vSUJjLUVENaP3jm5vNJzw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9vSUJjLUVENaP3jm5vNJzw"><span>在广州 游丝路</span></a></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本期联现人</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邓邓：寻迹文化迷踪</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>琳子：深博志愿者，番禺大神楼解读人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Ronnie：城市阅读者</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>本集音乐: </span></strong></em><span>&nbsp;黄霑 - 旱天雷</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>联系我们 @ 同名公众号 ： &nbsp;</span><em><strong><span>时空联现</span></strong></em></blockquote>]]></description>
