    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在最美的秋天，去 </span><em><strong><span>喀什古城</span></strong></em><span> 晃荡</span></p><span></span><p><span>围观古城载歌载舞的</span><em><strong><span>开城仪式、</span></strong></em><span>到迷宫般的古城小巷中去寻找</span><em><strong><span>空中花园</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>去挂着色彩斑斓的地毯的</span><em><strong><span>潮酷咖啡厅</span></strong></em><span>喝咖啡</span></p><span></span><p><span>坐在</span><em><strong><span>百年老茶馆</span></strong></em><span>，假装听得懂旁边维族老爷爷长长的絮叨，他们也许在讲当年那些探险家的故事？</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>汗巴扎</span></strong></em><span>（夜市）的各色食物都要尝一遍：缸子肉 烤肉串 椒麻鸡 </span><em><strong><span>沙朗刀克</span></strong></em><em><span>酸奶冰淇淋</span></em><span>、各色水果......</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>麦克抽 &nbsp;</span></strong><span>西域旅居客 ，目前定居喀什。丝路探索者、文化旅行顾问</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>璐子 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span>粤地精疆人， 刷博刷国保、野路子探四方</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>（联现人）</span><strong><span>邓邓 &nbsp;</span></strong><span>文化迷踪寻迹者</span></blockquote>]]></description>
